    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPRATE THE VANNI MANN CHARITYFOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      240.05,
      401.87,
      312.83
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS A Foundation called and known as the\u201cVanni Mann Charity Foundation \u201d has heretofore beenformed in Sri Lanka the purpose of effectually carrying outand transacting all objects and matters connected with thesaid Foundation according to the rules agreed to by themembers:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      326.09,
      401.86,
      386.63
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      399.89,
      401.9,
      423.59
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      436.85,
      401.75,
      460.43
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Vanni Mann CharityFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      473.69,
      401.88,
      595.79
    ],
    "text": "2.(1) From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cVanni Mann Charity Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as membersof the Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporatewith perpetual succession, under the name and style of \u201cVanniMann Charity Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued andhave full power and authority to have and use a common sealand alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      609.05,
      401.89,
      632.63
    ],
    "text": "3.(1) The general objects for which the Coporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      645.89,
      401.87,
      669.83
    ],
    "text": "(a)To conduct motivation programmes to encourageschool children;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      609.55,
      454.3,
      637.82
    ],
    "text": "Generalobjects of thecorporation",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
