    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      203.45,
      397.17,
      227.39
    ],
    "text": "(b)To participate in social, cultural and economicdevelopment of the country;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      241.49,
      397.19,
      265.55
    ],
    "text": "(c)To take measures to protect and discipline andcultural values of the people;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      279.65,
      375.46,
      290.99
    ],
    "text": "(d)to give assistance to develop worship places;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      304.97,
      397.19,
      329.03
    ],
    "text": "(e)to establish information technology centers for theadvanancement of scienific studies;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      343.25,
      397.16,
      367.43
    ],
    "text": "(f)to work towards to protect and develop all rights ofwomen and children;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      381.65,
      397.19,
      418.67
    ],
    "text": "(g)to promote peace,goodwill, understanding andcooperation among all communities and people ofSri Lanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      432.89,
      397.16,
      457.07
    ],
    "text": "(h)to assist needy school children to enable them tocontinue their education; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      471.29,
      397.21,
      495.47
    ],
    "text": "(i)to liaise and co-ordinate with other local and foreigninstitutions which have similar objects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      510.05,
      397.2,
      588.47
    ],
    "text": "4. (1) Management of the affairs of the Corporation shall,subject to the other provisions of this Act and the rules inforce for the time being of the corporation be administeredby a Committee of Management consisting of Chairman,Secretary, Treasurer and another eleven members elected inaccordance with such rules.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      603.89,
      397.2,
      656.03
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Committee of Management shall consist ofthe members of the Committee of Management holding officeon the day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
