    "text": "7.All debts and liabilities of the Foundation on the daypreceding the date of commencement of this Act, shall bepaid and discharge by the Corporation hereby constitutedand all debts due to, subscriptions and contributions payableto the Foundation on that day shall be paid to the Corporationfor the purposes of this Act.",
